<ConstraintsParameters Name="QES AdESQC TL based - Argentina Compatible" xmlns="http://dss.esig.europa.eu/validation/policy">
	<Description>Validates electronic signatures and indicates whether they are Advanced electronic Signatures (AdES), AdES supported by a Qualified Certificate (AdES/QC) or a
		Qualified electronic Signature (QES). This policy is adapted for Argentina certificates which may use SHA1 in CRLs and certificate chains.
		All certificates and their related chains supporting the signatures are validated against the EU Member State Trusted Lists and custom trusted keystore (this includes
		signer's certificate and certificates used to validate certificate validity status services - CRLs, OCSP, and time-stamps).
	</Description>
